            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.31.24+DEU.31.25+DEU.31.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 31:24-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hilukia omunyamurwa omukuru yaagira Shafani omuhandiiki ati: Naazoora ekitabo ky'Ebiragiro omu nju ya MUKAMA. Atyo Hilukia yaaha Shafani ekyo kitabo, yaakishoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Shafani omuhandiiki yaija ow'omugabe, yaamugambira ati: Abairu baawe baihire omu nju ya MUKAMA empiiha ezishangirwemu; baaziha abarikugireeberera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shafani omuhandiiki yaagaruka yaagira omugabe ati: Hilukia omunyamurwa yampa ekitabo. Atyo Shafani yaakimushomera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe ku yaahuriire ebigambo by'omu kitabo ky'Ebiragiro, yaataagura ebijwaro bye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
