                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atyo Hilukia omunyamurwa, Ahikaamu, Akiboora, Shafani na Asaaya baaza owa Hulida nabikazi muka Shalumu mwene Tikuva, mwijukuru wa Harihaasi, omubiiki w'ebijwaro; (omu biro ebyo ogwo mukazi akaba atwire Yerusaalemu omu kicweka kyayo kya kabiri) baagamba nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Mugambire omushaija obantumireho muti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyareeta akabi aha mwanya ogu n'aha batuuzi baamwo, nk'ebigambo byona ebihandiikirwe omu kitabo eki omugabe wa Yuda ashomire oku biri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:17"
