          "text": " Ahabw'okuba bakanyimuura, baayoterera baaruhanga abandi obubaane, ngu bangwise kubi n'ebi baakozire n'emikono yaabo byona, n'ahabw'ekyo ekiniga kyangye kiryayaka aha mwanya ogu, kandi tikiriraazibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
